  "notes": "'only egress rule' is checked as: every egress rule (separate rule resources) is 443 to the VPC CIDR, or every inline egress block of a security group goes to the VPC CIDR and ends at port 443 (inline from_port is not also pinned: one leaf takes one condition). 'every resource named after the workspace' is checked on the compute environment and queue; tags on VPC, subnets, compute environment and queue. The private route table's NAT route and its association with the private subnet are separate checks (one leaf cannot require two refs)."
